+//! Shared helpers for HiTechPay Vietnamese connectors (MoMo, VNPay, ZaloPay, Viettel Money,
+//! PayOS, SePay, Pay2S).
+//!
+//! * Vietnam local time (GMT+7) formatting used by most VN gateways
+//! * HMAC signing helpers
+//! * Payment memo / transfer-code generation and extraction for bank transfer reconciliation
+//! * NAPAS VietQR (EMVCo) payload builder with CRC16-CCITT
+
